# --- BSD verification scratch artifacts (verify_bsd branch) ---
# Scratch scripts, run logs, pickles, and large intermediate label lists from
# computing prove_BSD output. Fenced off so a stray `git add -A` can't sweep
# them into the PR diff. Root-anchored (leading /) so nothing inside lmfdb/ is
# affected. NOTE: bsd_results.csv is intentionally left TRACKABLE on the
# assumption it's (or becomes) your illustrative sample — commit it
# deliberately. If it's actually scratch, add it to this block.
